Workaround: deny image file reads in permission config.

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "permission": {
    "read": {
      "*": "allow",
      "*.png": "deny",
      "*.jpg": "deny",
      "*.jpeg": "deny",
      "*.gif": "deny",
      "*.webp": "deny",
      "*.svg": "deny",
      "*.bmp": "deny",
      "*.ico": "deny"
    }
  }
}
```

@WietRob how did you get this to work? I just updated my opencode to 1.2.12 and adjusted my opencode.json accordingly. Still, the auto compaction only kicks in at 75%.

```
